{"overview":"یک سرقت ۱۲ ماه برنامه‌ریزی می‌شود، ۱۲ ساعت اجرا می‌شود—و دزدی که در ۱۲ روز دستگیر نشود، هرگز دستگیر نخواهد شد. در سه خط زمانی پرهیجان، یک مامور اف‌بی‌آی و یک جنایتکار حرفه‌ای در بازی مرگبار گربه و موش در سراسر اروپا به یکدیگر می‌پیوندند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A heist takes 12 months to plan, 12 hours to execute—and a thief not caught within 12 days won't be caught at all. Across three pulse-pounding timelines, an FBI agent and a career criminal face off in a deadly game of cat and mouse through Europe.","tagline_en":"Get in. Get out. Get away.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":8,"y":2026,"poster":"/5CSL2ZWR9scRbrN8NqAy5C0MncY.jpg"}],"episodes":8,"crew":["Dudi Appleton","Jim Keeble"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US","GB","CA"],"cast":[{"name":"آنتونی مکی","role":"Jack Strickland","photo":"/vecvTm7SimizluJkyIwBxeLbvRm.jpg","en":"Anthony Mackie"},{"name":"جیمی درنان","role":"Paul Galvin","photo":"/qmTiAm3LII5moykSriVkJCeysKC.jpg","en":"Jamie Dornan"},{"name":"جک کسی","role":"Bobby Galvin","photo":"/z9lMOGw235m2HeCP4xlwQHXkq5X.jpg","en":"Jack Kesy"},{"name":"آگاته روسل","role":"Severine","photo":"/xVeismLfDnAnM6dh2Nwh6s7fzon.jpg","en":"Agathe Rousselle"},{"name":"سالی هارمسن","role":"Lena","photo":"/2JNkJ7UUAKwLkaPeOdzi0bQUzK4.jpg","en":"Sallie Harmsen"},{"name":"Julius Feldmeier","role":"Alberich","photo":"/pZcM4EMzsng5JqGkoGM6TGHUyJC.jpg"},{"name":"ژان بالیبار","role":"Bazin","photo":"/nvy943Oez5Grrulv3FzLjzN8OSM.jpg","en":"Jeanne Balibar"},{"name":"کالی ریس","role":"Kira","photo":"/ruLDXHnKA4aHEQCcFGDAJ7bLTdt.jpg","en":"Kali Reis"}],"trailer":"pWdt8WMCqnc","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/254630-12-12-12/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Apple TV","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/v9SnyvYt0U3KGgBH3Sbh3z4yODe.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/giKLP7saeUA0WykEPRyZUcOVv92.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/254630-12-12-12/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Ap